5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The old habit has clearly broken down. Before we pick a new system, we need to know the actual costs and time involved.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We need to quantify the time commitment before committing to a year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’d like to see how the workload actually distributes against who’s here. Fairness matters before we lock anything in.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I just want to stop guessing what state the rooms will be in. Predictability is my main worry here.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care most about keeping us on speaking terms. Let’s find a system that doesn’t turn us against each other.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the bathroom spray receipts and the management office rate sheet to pin down the monthly costs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll time a full pass with a stopwatch and check the bathroom grout to see how quickly it degrades.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the absences on the wall calendar and watch kitchen use for a fortnight to see who’s actually here and cooking.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I’ll look into what each housemate counts as done and the bathroom grout after the July scrub.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’ll read the note left by the previous tenants and scroll through the house chat rows to see what actually caused the friction.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll also review the standard terms of the outside firm to understand their arrival windows and requirements.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
